review:
I used a mod to Remove the female protagonist just prefer playing a guy in this sort of game, a bit awkward but playing as Jaylen was way cooler and the world is really fun to explore and feels truly massive and open world if you spend time hunting for secrets  quests and collecting , gameplay with guns update is way better too. I loved the art work lighting and there is just so much to explore that I can forgive the big cons.

THE BIG  CON;
awful story awful characters almost every character again is a woman for no reason than odd politics. You can be diverse ie ac odysseys and fun but clearly this is just to provoke a reaction. the only good female character is the mom and she barely has any role. id rathe see her story.

this game kinda fun but its fun 
